<title>ITALY: Olivetti board to meet later today-source.</title>
<headline>Olivetti board to meet later today-source.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of troubled information technology group Olivetti, whose shares fell around five percent on the Milan market, will meet later on Tuesday, an informed source said.</p>
<p>The latest wave of selling on Olivetti shares, which stood close to a historic low on Tuesday, has come amid market concern that the group's first half 1996 results will be worse than forecast.</p>
<p>Olivetti is expected to release its first half 1996 results on September 26.</p>
<p>Shares were 5.76 percent down at 721 lire per share at 1235 GMT after touching 711 earlier.</p>
</text>
